# Pelibatan Pemangku Kepentingan [2-29]

Stakeholder Engagement

WIKA BETON telah mengidentifikasi pemangku kepentingan internal dan eksternal berdasarkan penilaian dan pertimbangan faktor kebutuhan, peran, pengaruh, dan dampak. Kami terus berupaya menciptakan hubungan harmonis dan strategis guna menjaga keberlanjutan operasional Perseroan.

WIKA BETON has identified internal and external stakeholders based on the assessment and consideration of the factors of needs, roles, influences, and impacts. We always put the utmost effort into creating harmonious and strategic relations to maintain the Company's operational sustainability.

